<title>FRANCE: P&amp;O increases Calais/Dover frequency.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O increases Calais/Dover frequency.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>P&amp;O European Ferries said in a statement that it was increasing the number of sailings between Calais and Dover by 50 percent to 30 daily rotations, to accomodate a rise in passengers after the Chunnel fire.</p>
<p>P&amp;O said that passenger and vehicle traffic was up 55 percent since a fire in the cross-Channel rail tunnel operated by Eurotunnel SA/Plc on Monday closed the tunnel for several days.</p>
<p>P&amp;O said the Pride of Kent was rejoining the fleet on Friday and the five ships would make six return crossings a day instead of the normal five.</p>
<p>P&amp;O said the increased schedule would remain in place as long as necessary.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
